# Superpowers working docs (brainstorm/design specs, handoffs, implementation
# plans). Ephemeral by convention — the durable, committed architecture record
# lives in docs/adr/. Design specs already committed here stay tracked; a new
# spec worth committing needs `git add -f`.
docs/superpowers/plans/
docs/superpowers/specs/
